{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S09把“想在难受的时候有人陪”收窄成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，心理判断更重，少了X原句的开放余地。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事拆成短句，并突出每段真正发生变化的关键意思，观众更容易在听音乐时抓住要点，也更容易理解他为什么在怀念、愤怒、孤独和自我保护之间反复拉扯。感受词按照音乐节点出现，呼吸、停顿、舞步、音响变化和情绪起落都有更具体的呈现，既减轻了同时面对大量短词的负担，也让前后情绪变化更容易被听见和看见。Y偶尔有解释过满、替观众提前确定心理含义的问题，但整体的可读性、叙事连贯性和音乐感受的细腻程度都更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0d45594e-4b05-4428-b044-a9f40ac920e7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T193436530163Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:35:34.024291+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "57afb7fddb7c727aa80762f40aaa42a97c9ab845ed2fef2bebc3bbfcafaa3a03", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools